# warnings

## MODULE_LEVEL_DIRECTIVE

```text
[MODULE_LEVEL_DIRECTIVE] The semantics of the module level directive "use asm" in "main.js" may not be preserved when bundling.
   ╭─[ main.js:2:1 ]
   │
 2 │ 'use asm';
   │ ─────┬────  
   │      ╰────── module level directive may not be preserved
   │ 
   │ Help: For more information, see https://rolldown.rs/in-depth/directives#other-directives
───╯

```

